{
  "name": "KPL SAB 赛制 / KPL SAB League Format",
  "author": "L-ku",
  "version": "1.6.4",
  "mod_type": "native",
  "contains_code": true,
  "description": "把中国赛区改成 KPL 的 S/A/B 分组赛制：每组三个单循环（45 场），每轮积分清零并按名次重新分组（含卡位赛 BO7），赛季末统一 12 队双败 BO7 季后赛（16 场）加 7-10 名排位，推送最终名次与对阵新闻，并修正国际杯抽签的挂名队与重复席位。每个赛段开始（春季开档、夏季 6/22 转会期）先随机抽签分三组；第一轮显示为「KPL 一组/二组/三组」，第二轮起为 S 组/A 组/B 组，季后赛统一显示「KPL 季后赛」——命名只改显示层，不动联赛 ID、赛区和积分。底部「季后赛」按钮可展开完整 16 场对阵面板（轮次、日期时刻、队徽、实时比分），绕开原生页面只有 8 个卡位的问题，赛后推送当日战报。中国赛区（含 K 甲、青训队与新生成选手）统一使用 KPL 风格中文名，能力值不变。S/A/B 为同一联赛级别，不再有 S↔A 升降级、降级履历或赞助层级惩罚；B↔K甲 升降级保留。\n\n1.6.4 修复国际杯抽签崩溃（0.6.5 与新版都会中招）：B 组季后赛槽被清空后又被提前标成 finalized，补槽逻辑只看未 finalize 的容器，于是永远补不上，中国赛区在东区少供 2 队，抽签池只剩 14 队而越界崩溃。现在先补槽再 finalize。另修「当前年份」的内存偏移随更新挪位导致名额归一化静默失效，年份改从分配表条目内部读取，不再依赖其它内存偏移。\n1.6.0–1.6.3 兼容 0.7.0 Expansion 开档与经理跳槽、推挡性能优化（读取缓存）、详情页 OVR 与名单评分对齐；评分改用 2023 春–2026 夏十季官方数据按分路加权并并入生涯荣誉（小胖 92、长生 92、轩染 91、一诺 90）。\n1.1.0–1.5.0 中国赛区全中文名、S/A/B 同级、16 场季后赛面板与每日战报、2026 夏季赛真实大名单。\n建议与 KPL + Real LoL Teams 数据包一起使用。\n\nKPL (King Pro League) S/A/B format for the CN region: three single round-robins per group (45 matches), per-round standings reset with regrouping (plus BO7 card matches), and a unified 12-team double-elimination BO7 playoff (16 matches) with 7-10 placement games. Final-rank and bracket news are pushed, and international-cup draws get their placeholder teams and duplicate seats fixed. Each split opens with a random draw into three groups (at save start for Spring, at the 6/22 transfer window for Summer); round 1 is labelled \"KPL Group 1/2/3\", rounds 2-3 use \"KPL S/A/B\", and playoffs always show \"KPL Playoffs\" — display-only, never touching league ids, regions or standings. A \"Playoffs\" button opens a full 16-match bracket panel (round, date/time, logos, live scores), working around the native pages' 8-slot limit, with a daily report after each playoff day. Every CN athlete (second division, academy and newly generated) gets a KPL-style Chinese name without changing stats. S, A and B share one league tier: no S-to-A promotion/relegation, relegation tags or tier-based sponsor penalties; B-to-K甲 promotion is kept.\n\n1.6.4 fixes the international-cup draw crash (hit on both 0.6.5 and current builds): group B's playoff slots were cleared and then force-finalised in the same call, but the back-fill routine only looks at non-finalised containers, so B could never be refilled — CN supplied 2 teams short in the Challengers East pool, leaving 14 teams and an out-of-bounds fallback. The back-fill now runs before finalising. Also fixes the per-region slot normalisation silently doing nothing after the game moved the memory offset used to read the current year; the year is now read from inside the allocation entries themselves.\n1.6.0-1.6.3 add 0.7.0 Expansion and manager-move support, a faster management turn (read caching), and in-game OVR that matches the roster rating; ratings now use ten seasons of official data (2023 Spring - 2026 Summer) with career honours folded in.\n1.1.0-1.5.0 add Chinese names across the CN region, one tier for S/A/B, the 16-match playoff panel with daily reports, and the real 2026 Summer rosters.\nBest used together with the KPL + Real LoL Teams data mod.",
  "last_updated": "2026-10-25",
